The COST VIM Auto Accrual automation is an unattended UiPath process that runs monthly on WD1 to identify unposted VIM invoices, extract required data from SAP, apply business rules, and generate accrual postings. It prepares posting templates, uploads them into SAP, validates success, and distributes results to cost accountants. This ensures timely, accurate, and standardized accrual postings across all regions with minimal manual effort.
